---
import { whatsappUrl } from '../data/contact';
---
<section id="contato" aria-labelledby="contact-title" class="nexora-section contact">
    <div class="section-shell">
        <p class="section-kicker">Vamos conversar</p>
        <div class="contact-layout">
            <h2 id="contact-title">Seu negócio merece<br />ser <span>bem apresentado.</span></h2>
            <div class="contact-content">
                <p>Se chegou a hora de melhorar sua presença digital, a Nexora pode criar uma experiência pensada para o seu negócio.</p>
                <div class="contact-actions">
                    <a class="contact-primary" href={whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Quero meu site<span class="sr-only"> — conversar no WhatsApp, em nova aba</span></a>
                    <a class="contact-secondary" href={whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Falar no WhatsApp<span class="sr-only"> — em nova aba</span></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<style>
    .contact { background: #2a1b37; overflow: hidden; }
    .contact::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -1; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 96% 0%, #7b508044, transparent 65%), linear-gradient(125deg, #20142c, transparent 60%); pointer-events: none; }
    .contact .section-shell { padding-block: 108px 115px; }
    .contact .section-kicker { color: #dbbddf; }
    .contact-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .8fr; gap: 70px; align-items: end; }
    h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(46px, 4.6vw, 66px); line-height: 1.09; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.055em; text-wrap: pretty; }
    h2 span { color: #d4b8ed; }
    .contact-content p { max-width: 415px; margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: #ddcede; text-wrap: pretty; }
    .contact-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px 25px; align-items: center; margin-top: 28px; }
    .contact-primary { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 17px 22px; min-height: 60px; background: #e2caef; color: #25172f; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; white-space: nowrap; transition: background 180ms, transform 180ms; }
    .contact-primary span[aria-hidden] { font-size: 23px; line-height: 1; }
    .contact-primary:hover { background: #f0dffd; transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .contact-secondary { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 48px; font-size: 16px; color: #ede0f0; text-underline-offset: 6px; }
    .contact-secondary:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    @media (max-width: 1100px) { .contact-layout { gap: 40px; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr; } h2 { font-size: 50px; } }
    @media (max-width: 767px) {
        .contact .section-shell { padding-block: 72px 76px; }
        .contact-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 27px; }
        h2 { font-size: clamp(41px, 10.7vw, 57px); line-height: 1.1; }
        .contact-content p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; }
        .contact-actions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 13px; }
        .contact-primary { width: 100%; justify-content: center; } .contact-secondary { justify-content: center; }
    }

    @media (min-width: 1200px) {
        .contact .section-shell { padding-block: var(--desktop-section-space); }
        .contact-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, .8fr); gap: var(--desktop-gap); }
        h2 { font-size: 58px; }
    }
</style>
